        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:177. LEIBNIZ AN EHRENFRIED WALTHER VON TSCHIRNHAUS Hannover, Ende Mai 1678. [172.205b.] Romam ad Dn. Tschirnhusium fine Maji 1678. [ ... ] Caeterum dum reliqua tuarum literarum percurro, obiter animadverto Te scribere: multi admodum falso credunt artem combinatoriam esse [separatam] scientiam et ant...">
